# The generic extractor brain ships trained — the customcmd
# example runs out of the box; every other brain stays local.
!/custombrain.gob

# The chat and file brains ship trained too, for the same
# example: customcmd loads all three as data files behind
# its one prompt. (Their .intents.json sidecars are not
# matched by the *.gob rules and travel normally.)
!/brain.gob
!/filebrain.gob
